== the search path, in precedence order ==
  /p/tpl
  /home/me/.gbasic-studio/templates
  /usr/share/gbasic/stdlib
  /usr/share/gbasic-studio/templates
  with no project and no stdlib:
    /home/me/.gbasic-studio/templates
    /usr/share/gbasic-studio/templates

== and an id declared twice ==
templates: 2 from 2 file(s)
  greet
  only-far
  ! <t>/far/x.templates: "greet" is already defined by <t>/near/x.templates; this one is ignored

  greet -> <near>
  only-far -> <far only>
